        "content": "## scrape-doris-school\nPulls pending URLs from `scrape_queue`, conditional-GETs each Doris page (ETag + MD5 change detection), extracts with **gpt-4o-mini** (temp 0, JSON mode), upserts `schools` on `slug`, and refreshes `school_fees`.\n\n- System prompt source of truth: `src/agents/prompts/school-extraction.txt` — copied into **Build Extraction Request**; keep in sync.\n- Requires env: `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`.\n- MVP scope: `entry_points` not persisted (deferred to phase 2).\n- `extraction_confidence < 0.6` → school row flagged `needs_review` (queue still marked `done`)."
      }
    }
